 ?  Where should the nightly backup go?
    1 the NAS  /mnt/nas/backups on the LAN; I recommend it
    2 Backblaze B2  off site, about 2 USD a month for 400 GB; restic needs the key in
      ~/.config/restic/b2.env, and that file does not exist yet
    3 both  the NAS each night and B2 each Sunday
    4 an external disk  only when it is plugged in
    t type an answer   esc skip

